~B. The mirror was stolen.#Incorrect. Unsupported.
=
~C. The speaker moved to another planet.#Incorrect. Unsupported.
~D. The room was outside.#Incorrect. Not stated.
}

::CW_U04_L06_Q20::Poem: The first star opened above the roof. Which interpretation is best supported?{
~B. The star is a door handle.#Incorrect. Opened is figurative.
~C. The roof is broken.#Incorrect. Unsupported.
=
