::CW_U04_L06_Q24::Poem: The bridge disappeared in fog, but my feet kept moving. Which interpretation is best supported?{
~B. The speaker can see everything clearly.#Incorrect. Fog suggests limited vision.
=
~C. The bridge collapsed.#Incorrect. Disappeared in fog means hidden, not necessarily collapsed.
~D. The speaker stopped forever.#Incorrect. The feet kept moving.
}

